        keyTakeaways: ['C1 = automatic processing. If you "decode" before understanding, you\'re still at B2 speed.', 'Train at 1.25-1.5x speed. After overtraining, normal speed feels comfortable.', 'Process FUNCTION first (complaint, request, suggestion) — not individual words'],
